{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14178","headline":"秋馆雨後得弟兄书即事呈李明府 · 戎昱","name":"秋馆雨後得弟兄书即事呈李明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弟兄书忽到，一夜喜兼愁。\n空馆复闻雨，贫家怯到秋。\n坐中孤烛暗，窗外数萤流。\n试以他乡事，明朝问子游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}